WEBVTT

00:08.862 --> 00:10.034
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.137 --> 00:11.758
Kids: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:11.862 --> 00:13.275
I CAN'T HEARYOU!
我听不到你的声音！

00:13.379 --> 00:15.275
Kids: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：是啊，是啊，队长！

00:15.379 --> 00:18.172
♪ OHH...
♪ 噢...

00:18.275 --> 00:20.137
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.241 --> 00:22.206
Kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝

00:22.310 --> 00:24.241
Captain: ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
船长：♪ 吸水的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.344 --> 00:26.103
Kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝

00:26.206 --> 00:26.862
Captain: ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
船长：♪ 如果是航海废话

00:26.965 --> 00:27.620
BE SOMETHIN' YOU WISH ♪
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:27.724 --> 00:27.896
BE SOMETHIN' YOU WISH ♪
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:30.344 --> 00:32.344
Captain: ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪♪
船长：♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 ♪♪

00:32.448 --> 00:33.724
Kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝

00:33.827 --> 00:35.586
Captain: ♪ READY?
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？

00:35.689 --> 00:40.275
All: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS,
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS,
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
全部：♪ 海绵宝宝，
海绵宝宝，
海绵宝宝 ♪

00:40.379 --> 00:43.896
Captain: ♪ SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:44.000 --> 00:46.103
Captain: [LAUGHING]
队长：[笑]

00:46.206 --> 00:48.275
[WHISTLING]
[口哨声]

00:48.379 --> 00:54.172
[WAVES CRASHING
AND SEAGULLS SQUAWKING]
[海浪拍打
还有海鸥的叫声]

01:02.000 --> 01:05.517
Narrator: IT IS A VERY
SPECIAL DAY IN BIKINI BOTTOM.
旁白：这是一个非常
比基尼泳裤的特殊日子。

01:05.620 --> 01:07.034
SpongeBob: I'M READY!
海绵宝宝：我准备好了！

01:07.137 --> 01:08.931
♪ I'M READY, I'M READY
♪ 我准备好了，我准备好了

01:09.034 --> 01:10.724
PATRICK, DID YOU BRING
MY FLASHCARDS?
帕特里克，你带了吗？
我的抽认卡？

01:10.827 --> 01:12.137
RIGHT HERE, BUDDY.
就在这里，伙计。

01:12.241 --> 01:16.344
EVERYTHING YOU NEED TO PASS
THE TEST IS ON THESE CARDS.
您需要通过的一切
测试就在这些卡上。

01:18.379 --> 01:19.620
NO, PATRICK!
不，帕特里克！

01:19.724 --> 01:22.000
HEY, LEARNING TASTES GOOD.
嘿，学习的味道很好。

01:22.103 --> 01:23.448
PATRICK, I NEEDED THOSE.
帕特里克，我需要那些。

01:23.551 --> 01:25.000
OH, FIDDLESTICKS!
哦，小提琴！

01:25.103 --> 01:27.758
YOU'VE TAKEN THAT DRIVING TEST
MORE TIMES THAN ANYONE.
您已经参加了驾驶考试
比任何人都多。

01:27.862 --> 01:29.310
57 TIMES.
57次。

01:29.413 --> 01:32.068
WELL THEN,
58 IS YOUR LUCKY NUMBER!
那么，
58 是你的幸运数字！

01:32.172 --> 01:34.517
YOU'RE GONNA PASS
THAT DRIVING TEST, SPONGEBOB,
你会通过的
那次驾驶考试，海绵宝宝，

01:34.620 --> 01:36.206
BECAUSE YOU'RE A WINNER.
因为你是赢家。

01:36.310 --> 01:37.103
I'M A WINNER?
我是赢家？

01:37.206 --> 01:38.344
WHO'S A WINNER?
谁是赢家？

01:38.448 --> 01:39.275
I'M A WINNER.
我是赢家。

01:39.379 --> 01:40.689
WHO'S A WINNER?
谁是赢家？

01:40.793 --> 01:41.827
I'M A WINNER.
我是赢家。

01:41.931 --> 01:43.275
WHO'S A WINNER?
谁是赢家？

01:43.379 --> 01:44.206
I'M A WINNER!
我是赢家！

01:44.310 --> 01:46.586
I'M A WINNER, I'M A WINNER!
我是胜利者，我是胜利者！

01:46.689 --> 01:49.241
Narrator: ONE MINUTE,
THIRTY-SEVEN SECONDS LATER...
旁白：一分钟，
三十七秒后……

01:49.344 --> 01:52.137
[CRYING]
[哭泣]

01:52.241 --> 01:54.517
HOW'D YOU DO, WINNER?
获胜者，你怎么样？

01:54.620 --> 01:57.862
[CRYING]
[哭泣]

01:57.965 --> 01:59.068
LET'S SEE THAT LICENSE.
让我们看看该许可证。

01:59.172 --> 02:01.551
I DIDN'T GET A LICENSE, PATRICK.
我没有拿到驾照，帕特里克。

02:01.655 --> 02:03.655
ARE THEY GONNA MAIL IT TO YOU?
他们会把它邮寄给你吗？

02:03.758 --> 02:06.206
NO, PATRICK, I FAILED
THE BOATING TEST.
不，帕特里克，我失败了
划船测试。

02:06.310 --> 02:09.000
I GUESS 58 WASN'T
MY LUCKY NUMBER, AFTER ALL.
我猜 58 不是
毕竟是我的幸运数字。

02:09.103 --> 02:10.068
NO WAY!
决不！

02:10.172 --> 02:12.689
58 IS, LIKE,
THE LUCKIEST NUMBER EVER.
58 是，喜欢，
有史以来最幸运的数字。

02:12.793 --> 02:14.275
THE TEST MUST BE RIGGED.
测试必须被操纵。

02:14.379 --> 02:16.103
LET'S JUST GO HOME, PATRICK.
我们回家吧，帕特里克。

02:16.206 --> 02:19.655
WE'RE NOT GOIN' ANYWHERE UNTIL
I GET TO THE BOTTOM OF THIS!
我们不会去任何地方直到
我已经彻底明白了！

02:19.758 --> 02:21.275
I'M TAKIN' THAT TEST MYSELF!
我正在自我测试！

02:21.379 --> 02:22.172
SpongeBob: NO, PATRICK!
海绵宝宝：不，帕特里克！

02:22.275 --> 02:23.655
I'VE BEEN TRAINING FOR YEARS.
我已经训练多年了。

02:23.758 --> 02:26.241
THEY'LL EAT YOU ALIVE.
他们会活活吃掉你。

02:26.344 --> 02:27.586
PLEASE, SPONGEBOB.
拜托，海绵宝宝。

02:27.689 --> 02:29.689
I THINK I KNOW WHAT I'M DOING.
我想我知道我在做什么。

02:29.793 --> 02:30.551
NO, PATRICK.
不，帕特里克。

02:30.655 --> 02:32.103
SpongeBob: [SCREAMING]: NO!
海绵宝宝：[尖叫]：不！

02:33.965 --> 02:34.689
GOOD MORNING.
早上好。

02:34.793 --> 02:36.275
YOU'RE NOT THE JUDGE OF ME!
你不是我的评判者！

02:36.379 --> 02:38.482
ACTUALLY, I AM.
事实上，我是。

02:38.586 --> 02:41.517
LET THE TESTING BEGIN!
让测试开始吧！

02:41.620 --> 02:43.586
I SHOULDN'T HAVE LET HIM DO IT.
我不应该让他这样做。

02:43.689 --> 02:45.413
WHAT KIND OF FRIEND AM I?
我是什么样的朋友？

02:45.517 --> 02:46.310
Patrick: SPONGEBOB, SPONGEBOB!
帕特里克：海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝！

02:46.413 --> 02:47.793
I'M HERE FOR YOU, BUDDY.
我在这里等你，伙计。

02:47.896 --> 02:49.517
Patrick: I PASSED MY TEST.
帕特里克：我通过了测试。

02:49.620 --> 02:51.896
YOU GOT A PERFECT SCORE?
您获得满分了吗？

02:52.000 --> 02:52.793
YEAH!
是的！

02:52.896 --> 02:54.793
I THOUGHT YOU SAID IT WAS HARD.
我以为你说这很难。

02:54.896 --> 02:57.586
PERFECT... SCORE.
完美...得分。

02:57.689 --> 02:58.931
COME ON.
快点。

02:59.034 --> 03:02.448
I'VE GOTTA GET MY PICTURE TAKEN
FOR MY NEW LICENSE.
我得拍张照片
为了我的新许可证。

03:02.551 --> 03:04.517
STAND BEHIND THE LINE, SIR.
站在队伍后面，先生。

03:04.620 --> 03:05.965
HOW DO I LOOK?
我看起来怎么样？

03:06.068 --> 03:07.448
LIKE A WINNER.
像一个胜利者。

03:07.551 --> 03:07.965
READY?
准备好？

03:08.068 --> 03:09.275
READY!
准备好！

03:09.379 --> 03:11.413
[APPLAUSE AND MUSIC]
[掌声和音乐]

03:11.517 --> 03:12.206
HUH?
嗯？

03:12.310 --> 03:16.000
CONGRATULATIONS, MR. STAR!
恭喜你，先生。星星！

03:16.103 --> 03:19.275
YOU'RE THE ONE-MILLIONTH PERSON
TO PASS THE TEST.
你是百万分之一的人
通过测试。

03:19.379 --> 03:21.965
DOES THAT MEAN
I GET A FREE KEY CHAIN?
这是否意味着
我可以获得免费钥匙链吗？

03:22.068 --> 03:23.206
UH, NO.
呃，不。

03:23.310 --> 03:24.137
OH.
哦。

03:24.241 --> 03:27.482
YOU GET A BRAND-NEW BOATMOBILE!
您将获得一辆全新的移动船！

03:27.586 --> 03:31.758
Fish: THE NEW BASS BLASTER 3000,
THE ULTIMATE BOATING MACHINE.
鱼：新款 BASS BLASTER 3000，
终极划船机。

03:31.862 --> 03:32.931
YEAH, ALL RIGHT!
是的，好吧！

03:33.034 --> 03:35.206
Fish: WOMEN WILL WANT YOU!
鱼：女人会想要你！

03:35.310 --> 03:36.310
[SIGHING]
[叹息]

03:36.413 --> 03:38.620
Fish: MEN WILL WANT TO BE YOU.
鱼：男人会想成为你。

03:38.724 --> 03:40.413
[SIGHING]
[叹息]

03:40.517 --> 03:42.793
Fish: YOU'LL BE THE ENVY
OF YOUR FRIENDS.
鱼：你会被人羡慕的
您朋友的。

03:42.896 --> 03:44.482
[SEETHING]
[沸腾]

03:44.586 --> 03:45.655
ISN'T THIS GREAT?
这不是很棒吗？

03:45.758 --> 03:48.103
I GOT MY LICENSE AND A NEW BOAT.
我拿到了执照和一艘新船。

03:48.206 --> 03:51.517
I'M... SO... HAPPY... FOR YOU.
我……非常……为你高兴。

03:51.620 --> 03:54.000
[HORN BLASTING " LA CUCARACHA"]
[号角吹响“LA CUCARACHA”]

03:54.103 --> 03:54.620
WHOA!
哇啊！

03:54.724 --> 03:56.689
THE HORN WORKS.
喇叭起作用了。

03:57.827 --> 03:59.000
WHOO!
哇！

03:59.103 --> 04:01.862
THIS IS THE GREATEST DAY EVER,
RIGHT, SPONGEBOB?
这是有史以来最伟大的一天，
对吧，海绵宝宝？

04:01.965 --> 04:03.241
RIGHT, PATRICK.
对了，帕特里克。

04:03.344 --> 04:06.793
I CAN'T THINK OF ONE THING
THAT WOULD MAKE THIS DAY BETTER.
我想不出一件事
这会让这一天变得更好。

04:06.896 --> 04:08.689
EXCEPT MAYBE GETTING MY LICENSE.
除非获得我的执照。

04:08.793 --> 04:13.862
MAYBE IF YOU APPLY YOURSELF,
YOU COULD BE THE TWO-MILLIONTH
PERSON TO GET HIS LICENSE.
也许如果你自己努力，
你可能是第二百万
获得执照的人。

04:13.965 --> 04:15.068
TWO-MILLIONTH?
百万分之二？

04:15.172 --> 04:18.068
THEN YOU COULD GET A FREE BOAT,
JUST LIKE ME.
然后你就可以得到一艘免费的船，
就像我一样。

04:18.172 --> 04:19.275
YEAH, "JUST LIKE YOU."
是的，“就像你一样。”

04:19.379 --> 04:21.965
I TRY TO SERVE AS
AN INSPIRATION TO OTHERS.
我尝试充当
对他人的启发。

04:22.068 --> 04:23.482
CAN WE GO HOME NOW?
我们现在可以回家了吗？

04:23.586 --> 04:25.862
WE'VE BEEN DRIVIN' AROUND
YOUR HOUSE FOR HOURS.
我们一直在开车
您的房子数小时。

04:25.965 --> 04:26.965
Patrick: I KNOW!
帕特里克：我知道！

04:27.068 --> 04:29.172
IT'S A LOT FASTER THAN WALKING,
ISN'T IT?
它比步行快得多，
不是吗？

04:29.275 --> 04:30.655
THANKS FOR THE RIDE, PATRICK.
感谢您的搭车，帕特里克。

04:30.758 --> 04:32.241
NO PROBLEM, BUDDY.
没问题，伙计。

04:32.344 --> 04:35.620
YOU CAN'T HELP
BEING A... PEDESTRIAN.
你无能为力
作为一个……行人。

04:35.724 --> 04:36.827
[SHUDDERING]
[颤抖]

04:39.724 --> 04:42.862
[IMITATING PATRICK'S SHUDDERING]
[模仿帕特里克的颤抖]

04:43.827 --> 04:45.931
[SNORING]
[打鼾]

04:46.034 --> 04:47.103
[ENGINE REVVING]
[发动机转速]

04:51.137 --> 04:53.862
PATRICK, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
帕特里克，你在做什么？

04:53.965 --> 04:56.275
I'M TRYING TO
WORK ON MY BOATMOBILE.
我正在尝试
在我的船上工作。

04:56.379 --> 04:58.068
NOW, COULD YOU KEEP IT DOWN?
现在，你能小声点吗？

04:58.172 --> 05:01.137
IT'S 3:00 IN THE MORNING, PEOPLE
ARE TRYING TO SLEEP.
人们，现在是凌晨 3:00
正在尝试睡觉。

05:01.241 --> 05:01.862
UGH.
啊。

05:04.000 --> 05:07.448
4:00. [YAWNING]
4:00。 [打哈欠]

05:07.551 --> 05:08.793
[DOORBELL RINGING]
[门铃响]

05:08.896 --> 05:12.482
WHO COULD BE AT THE DOOR
AT THIS- OW, WHA-, [SCREAMING]
谁可能在门口
此时此刻，哇，[尖叫]

05:12.586 --> 05:14.000
NOW WHAT IS IT, PATRICK?
现在是什么，帕特里克？

05:14.103 --> 05:16.689
YOU WILL NEVER GUESS WHAT
HAPPENED TO ME TODAY.
你永远猜不到是什么
今天发生在我身上。

05:16.793 --> 05:18.137
YOU GOT YOUR LICENSE?
你拿到驾照了吗？

05:18.241 --> 05:18.793
YEAH!
是的！

05:20.137 --> 05:21.241
BUT THAT'S NOT ALL.
但这还不是全部。

05:21.344 --> 05:22.724
YOU GOT A NEW BOAT.
你得到了一艘新船。

05:22.827 --> 05:23.586
YEAH.
是的。

05:23.689 --> 05:25.344
HAVE YOU BEEN FOLLOWIN' ME?
你一直在关注我吗？

05:25.448 --> 05:28.689
YOU KNOW, YOU NEED TO GET
YOUR OWNLIFE.
你知道，你需要得到
你自己的生活。

05:30.344 --> 05:33.862
I JUST NEED
A FEW MINUTES SLEEP.
我只需要
睡几分钟。

05:33.965 --> 05:35.379
[HORN BLOWING]
[喇叭吹响]

05:37.310 --> 05:38.172
MAOW?
毛？

05:38.275 --> 05:40.620
YES, GARY, I SAW HIS NEW BOAT.
是的，加里，我看到了他的新船。

05:42.448 --> 05:43.827
SO TIRED.
这么累。

05:43.931 --> 05:44.689
[HORN HONKING]
[喇叭鸣响]

05:44.793 --> 05:47.344
HEY, BUDDY, NEED A RIDE TO WORK?
嘿，伙计，需要搭车去上班吗？

05:47.448 --> 05:49.827
THANKS, PATRICK,
BUT I'D RATHER WALK TO WORK.
谢谢，帕特里克，
但我宁愿步行去上班。

05:53.103 --> 05:57.482
BOY, I NEVER REALIZED HOW EMPTY
LIFE IS WITHOUT A LICENSE.
男孩，我从来没有意识到有多空虚
生活没有许可证。

05:57.586 --> 05:58.689
THANKS FOR THE RIDE.
感谢您乘坐。

05:58.793 --> 06:00.482
NO PROBLEM, BUDDY.
没问题，伙计。

06:00.586 --> 06:04.172
YOU CAN GIVE MERIDES
ONCE YOU GET YOUR LICENSE.
你可以给予 MERIDES
一旦您获得许可证。

06:04.275 --> 06:06.275
I MEAN, IFYOU GET YOUR LICENSE.
我的意思是，如果你获得了许可证。

06:06.379 --> 06:07.586
[GROWLING]
[咆哮]

06:07.689 --> 06:10.517
THAT'S IT, I AM THROUGH
DRIVING AROUND WITH PATRICK.
就这样，我已经完成了
和帕特里克一起开车。

06:10.620 --> 06:13.000
IF I HAVE TO SEE
ONE MOREBOATMOBILE...
如果我一定要看
又一艘移动船...

06:13.103 --> 06:15.068
SPONGEBOB, YOU'RE MANNIN'
THE DRIVE-THROUGH.
海绵宝宝，你来了
驾车穿过。

06:15.172 --> 06:16.896
WHEN DID WE GET A DRIVE-THROUGH?
我们什么时候有得来速服务？

06:17.000 --> 06:20.793
I REALIZE
THERE'S A LOT OF YOUNG PEOPLE
"ON THE GO" THESE DAYS.
我意识到
有很多年轻人
这些天“在旅途中”。

06:20.896 --> 06:23.482
THEY DON'T HAVE TIME
TO SIT DOWN AND EAT.
他们没有时间
坐下来吃饭。

06:23.586 --> 06:27.034
THEY'RE TOO BUSY,
OUT ON THE OPEN ROAD,
LIVIN' THEIR DREAMS.
他们太忙了，
在开阔的道路上，
实现他们的梦想。

06:27.137 --> 06:28.827
I USED TO HAVE A DREAM.
我曾经有一个梦想。

06:28.931 --> 06:29.689
YEAH?
是的？

06:29.793 --> 06:31.448
I USED TO HAVE A KIDNEY STONE.
我曾经患有肾结石。

06:31.551 --> 06:32.551
EVERYTHING PASSES EVENTUALLY.
一切都会过去的。

06:32.655 --> 06:35.103
NOW, STOP DREAMIN',
AND WORK FOR A LIVIN'.
现在，停止梦想，
并为生计而工作。

06:36.206 --> 06:38.413
WELCOME TO THE KRUSTY KRAB,
MAY I- OW!
欢迎来到蟹堡王，
我可以——噢！

06:38.517 --> 06:39.827
[HORN HONKING " LA CUCARACHA"]
[喇叭“LA CUCARACHA”]

06:39.931 --> 06:42.172
THE HORN STILLWORKS.
号角仍然有效。

06:46.482 --> 06:47.275
HEY, SPONGEBOB.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

06:47.379 --> 06:48.862
WHAT'S WITH THE HELMET, PATRICK?
帕特里克，头盔怎么样？

06:48.965 --> 06:53.448
WELL, SINCE I'M NOW
AN EXPERT DRIVER, I HAVE TO
KEEP UP MY IMAGE.
好吧，既然我现在
我必须成为一名专业司机
保持我的形象。

06:53.551 --> 06:54.931
UH-HUH.
嗯嗯。

06:55.724 --> 06:58.793
BOY, DRIVING IS SOEASY.
男孩，开车太容易了。

06:58.896 --> 06:59.758
OH.
哦。

06:59.862 --> 07:02.206
DO YOU WANT ME
TO GIVE YOU LESSONS?
你想要我吗
给你教训？

07:02.310 --> 07:05.379
OH, THAT WOULD BE GREAT.
哦，那太好了。

07:05.482 --> 07:06.103
OOH!
哦！

07:06.206 --> 07:08.620
SpongeBob: PATRICK!
海绵宝宝：帕特里克！

07:08.724 --> 07:10.275
HI, MOMMY, HI, DADDY.
嗨，妈妈，嗨，爸爸。

07:10.379 --> 07:13.275
PATRICK, HOW MANY TIMES
DO WE HAVE TO TELL YOU?
帕特里克，多少次了
我们必须告诉你吗？

07:13.379 --> 07:15.344
WE'RE SPONGEBOB'S MOM AND DAD,
NOT YOURS.
我们是海绵宝宝的爸爸妈妈，
不是你的。

07:15.448 --> 07:16.068
WHAT?
什么？

07:16.172 --> 07:17.172
I'M AN ORPHAN?
我是孤儿？

07:17.275 --> 07:18.413
OH, BUT GUESS WHAT.
哦，但是你猜怎么着。

07:18.517 --> 07:19.931
I PASSED MY DRIVER'S TEST.
我通过了驾驶考试。

07:20.034 --> 07:22.034
THAT'S GREAT, PATRICK.
太棒了，帕特里克。

07:22.137 --> 07:25.068
SPONGEBOB FAILED HIS TEST,
SO DON'T MENTION IT.
海绵宝宝没有通过测试，
所以别提了。

07:25.172 --> 07:28.172
OH, WE KNOW HOW TO
STAY CLEAR OF THATMINEFIELD.
哦，我们知道怎么做
远离那个雷区。

07:28.275 --> 07:29.448
MOM!
妈妈！

07:29.551 --> 07:32.862
WELL, I'VE GOTTA TAKE
MR. WALKS-A-LOT BACK HOME.
好吧，我必须采取
先生。经常步行回家。

07:32.965 --> 07:35.000
HEH, HE'S ALWAYS
ASKIN' FOR RIDES.
呵呵，他总是
搭车。

07:35.103 --> 07:36.344
HEY.
嘿。

07:37.172 --> 07:38.827
EVEN PATRICK HAS A LICENSE.
甚至帕特里克也有执照。

07:38.931 --> 07:39.827
[SIGHING][SIGHING]
[叹气][叹气]

07:40.896 --> 07:43.137
LET'S SEE WHAT THIS BABY CAN DO.
让我们看看这个宝宝能做什么。

07:46.758 --> 07:50.172
PATRICK, THE SPEED LIMIT
IS 40 MILES PER HOUR.
帕特里克，速度限制
时速为 40 英里。

07:50.275 --> 07:51.655
YEAH, YEAH.
是啊是啊。

07:52.413 --> 07:55.000
SpongeBob: FORTY-AND-A-HALF
MILES PER HOUR.
海绵宝宝：四十半
每小时英里数。

07:55.103 --> 07:56.793
THAT'S ALMOST 41 MILES PER HOUR.
几乎每小时 41 英里。

07:56.896 --> 07:57.689
HE'S SPEEDING.
他超速了。

07:57.793 --> 07:58.896
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

07:59.000 --> 08:01.965
STOP THIS CAR.
停下这辆车。

08:02.068 --> 08:03.827
WHAT, WHERE, WHO?
什么、哪里、谁？

08:03.931 --> 08:08.310
OFFICER, IT IS MY CIVIC DUTY
TO REPORT THAT THE DRIVER
OF THIS VEHICLE IS SPEEDING.
警官，这是我的公民义务
报告司机
这辆车正在超速行驶。

08:08.413 --> 08:11.000
WHY DON'T YOU CLOCK HIM
WITH YOUR RADAR GUN?
你为什么不给他计时
用你的雷达枪吗？

08:11.103 --> 08:12.241
UM, O.K.
嗯，好的。

08:12.344 --> 08:14.689
ACTUALLY, HE'S GOING 40 MILES
UNDERTHE LIMIT.
事实上，他要行驶 40 英里
在限制之下。

08:14.793 --> 08:19.275
SO MOVE ALONG BEFORE
I RUN YOUIN, TATTLETALE.
所以先走吧
我跑你了，告密者。

08:19.379 --> 08:22.034
ARE YOU SURE
YOU DON'T WANNA RUN HIM IN?
你确定吗
你不想把他拉进来吗？

08:24.931 --> 08:26.586
THAT'S A RED LIGHT, PATRICK.
那是红灯，帕特里克。

08:26.689 --> 08:28.275
AUGH!
啊！

08:29.931 --> 08:30.655
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

08:30.758 --> 08:32.448
YOU JUST RAN THREE RED LIGHTS!
你刚刚闯了三个红灯！

08:32.551 --> 08:33.620
SO?
所以？

08:33.724 --> 08:35.379
YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO STOP.
你应该停下来。

08:35.482 --> 08:38.551
I THINK THE DRIVING GENIUS
KNOWS WHAT HE'S DOING.
我认为驾驶天才
知道他在做什么。

08:38.655 --> 08:40.931
DRIVING GENIUS?
驾驶天才？

08:41.034 --> 08:43.310
WOULD A GENIUS MAKE
AN ILLEGAL U-TURN?
天才会做吗
非法掉头？

08:43.413 --> 08:44.206
THROUGH AN ORPHANAGE?
通过孤儿院？

08:44.310 --> 08:46.000
THEY RAN FOR IT IN TIME.
他们及时赶了上去。

08:46.103 --> 08:48.206
WHAT ARE YOU SO MAD ABOUT?
你为什么这么生气？

08:48.310 --> 08:50.379
I SHOULD'VE GOTTEN THAT LICENSE!
我应该获得该许可证！

08:50.482 --> 08:52.931
AND THIS SHOULD BE
MYBOATMOBILE.
这应该是
我的船移动。

08:53.034 --> 08:54.551
HOW CAN YOU SAY THAT?
你怎么能这么说呢？

08:54.655 --> 08:58.448
IF YOU WERE MY FRIEND,
YOU'D BE HAPPY FOR ME
GETTING MY LICENSE.
如果你是我的朋友，
你会为我感到高兴
获得我的执照。

08:58.551 --> 09:02.413
IF YOU WERE MY FRIEND,
YOU WOULDN'T RUB YOUR LICENSE
IN MY FACE.
如果你是我的朋友，
你不会擦掉你的执照
当着我的面。

09:02.517 --> 09:05.068
I'M NOT RUBBING MY LICENSE
IN YOUR FACE.
我不会破坏我的执照
在你的脸上。

09:05.172 --> 09:07.586
THISIS RUBBING MY LICENSE
IN YOUR FACE.
这擦了我的驾照
在你的脸上。

09:07.689 --> 09:10.413
SpongeBob: [MUFFLED NOISES]
海绵宝宝：[低沉的声音]

09:13.724 --> 09:16.000
OH, GIVE ME THAT!
哦，给我那个！

09:16.103 --> 09:18.103
I'VE WORKED MY WHOLE LIFE
FOR THIS!
I'VE WORKED MY WHOLE LIFE
为此！

09:18.206 --> 09:19.896
YOU DON'T DESERVE THIS!
你不应该得到这个！

09:22.172 --> 09:25.103
[LAUGHING]
[笑]

09:25.206 --> 09:27.517
HUH, LITTERBUGS.
嗯，垃圾虫。

09:27.620 --> 09:30.275
THISIS WHY I JOINED THE FORCE.
这就是我加入部队的原因。

09:30.379 --> 09:32.965
[POLICE SIREN WAILING]IT'S THE POLICE!
[警笛哀嚎]是警察！

09:33.068 --> 09:34.758
PULL IT OVER, LITTERBUG.
把它拉过来，垃圾虫。

09:34.862 --> 09:36.448
LITTERBUG?
垃圾虫？

09:36.551 --> 09:37.586
NO!
不！

09:37.689 --> 09:39.758
OOH, I GOT ME A RUNNER.
哦，我有一个跑步者。

09:40.862 --> 09:43.068
PATRICK, WHAT DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE DOING?
帕特里克，你觉得怎么样
你在做什么？

09:43.172 --> 09:44.482
I DON'T KNOW!
我不知道！

09:44.586 --> 09:46.655
I DON'T HAVE A LICENSE ANYMORE.
我没有执照了。

09:48.482 --> 09:49.275
LOOK OUT!
当心！

09:50.862 --> 09:52.137
[SCREAMING][SCREAMING]
[尖叫][尖叫]

09:52.241 --> 09:53.586
AUGH!AUGH!
啊！啊！

09:53.689 --> 09:54.206
WHOA!WHOA!
哇！哇！

09:54.310 --> 09:55.517
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

09:55.620 --> 09:57.448
[POLICE SIRENS WAILING]
[警笛鸣响]

09:59.068 --> 10:04.000
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

10:08.137 --> 10:09.448
90 DAYS.
90 天。

10:09.551 --> 10:12.068
AND I HOPE YOU LEARNED
A VALUABLE LESSON
ABOUT LITTERING.
我希望你学到了
宝贵的一课
关于乱扔垃圾。

10:12.172 --> 10:13.448
SO LONG, BUDDY.
再见，伙计。

10:13.551 --> 10:15.379
DON'T FORGET TO FEED GARY.
别忘了喂加里。

10:15.482 --> 10:17.172
SOMETIMES YOU FORGET TO
FEED HIM.
有时你会忘记
喂他。

10:17.275 --> 10:19.206
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

10:19.310 --> 10:21.275
PATRICK CAN'T SURVIVE IN PRISON.
帕特里克在监狱里无法生存。

10:21.379 --> 10:22.931
HE'S TOO SOFT.
他太软弱了。

10:23.034 --> 10:23.655
WAIT!
等待！

10:23.758 --> 10:25.068
PATRICK'S INNOCENT.
帕特里克是无辜的。

10:25.172 --> 10:28.000
I TORE UP PATRICK'S LICENSE
AND THREW IT OUT THE WINDOW.
我撕毁了帕特里克的驾照
然后把它扔出窗外。

10:28.103 --> 10:29.241
I'M THE LITTERBUG.
我是垃圾虫。

10:29.344 --> 10:30.655
TAKE ME, INSTEAD.
就拿我来说吧。

10:30.758 --> 10:35.344
WELL, CONSIDERIN'
THERE'S NO LEGAL PRECEDENT...
好吧，考虑一下
没有法律先例...

10:35.448 --> 10:36.551
OH, WHAT THE HECK.
哦，到底是什么？

10:36.655 --> 10:37.344
90 DAYS!
90 天！

10:40.827 --> 10:44.034
Narrator: ONE DEBT
TO SOCIETY LATER...
旁白：一笔债务
以后走向社会...

10:44.137 --> 10:45.896
[BEEPING]
[嘟嘟声]

10:46.000 --> 10:52.000
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]

10:57.655 --> 10:58.827
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

10:58.931 --> 11:00.931
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

11:01.034 --> 11:02.724
I'M GLAD YOU PASSED THE TEST.
我很高兴你通过了测试。

11:02.827 --> 11:04.620
I'M GLAD YOU HAVE A LICENSE.
我很高兴您拥有许可证。

11:04.724 --> 11:07.482
AND TO PROVE IT,
I MADE YOU THIS.
为了证明这一点，
这是我给你做的。

11:07.586 --> 11:09.310
SpongeBob: PALS FOREVER.
海绵宝宝：永远的好朋友。

11:09.413 --> 11:11.413
LET'S PUT IT
ON YOUR BOATMOBILE, BUDDY.
让我们把它
在你的移动船上，伙计。

11:11.517 --> 11:14.586
UH, I DON'T HAVE
A BOATMOBILE ANYMORE.
呃，我没有
不再是移动船。

11:14.689 --> 11:15.724
WHAT?
什么？

11:15.827 --> 11:18.551
IT STOPPED WORKIN',
SO I THREW IT AWAY.
它停止工作了，
所以我把它扔掉了。

11:18.655 --> 11:20.310
THE NEEDLE WAS ON "E."
针在“E”上。

11:20.413 --> 11:22.413
YEAH, I FIGURED
THAT MUST MEAN "END."
是的，我想到了
这必定意味着“结束”。

11:22.517 --> 11:25.206
OH, THEN WHAT DO WE DO
WITH THIS?
哦，那我们该怎么办
有了这个？

11:26.413 --> 11:27.379
[DINGING NOISE]
[叮叮声]

11:28.241 --> 11:29.068
HOW'S THAT?
怎么样？

11:29.172 --> 11:30.724
SpongeBob: YEAH!
海绵宝宝：是啊！

11:30.827 --> 11:32.000
READY, BUDDY?
准备好了吗，伙计？

11:32.103 --> 11:33.413
READY, PAL.
准备好了，朋友。

11:33.517 --> 11:37.551
[MAKING ENGINE NOISES]
[制造发动机噪音]

11:37.655 --> 11:40.344
WOO, WOO!
呜呜！

11:44.000 --> 11:50.000
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]
[♪...]

11:57.310 --> 11:57.793
YEAH?
是的？

11:57.896 --> 11:59.206
GOOD DAY, SIR.
美好的一天，先生。

11:59.310 --> 11:59.793
I AM...
我是...

11:59.896 --> 12:00.793
[GASPING]
[喘气]

12:00.896 --> 12:02.793
I KNOW EXACTLY WHO YOU ARE!
我完全知道你是谁！

12:02.896 --> 12:06.793
AH, THERE'S NOTHING LIKE
SPENDING SOME QUALITY TIME
WITH MY GAR-GAR.
啊，没有什么比
度过一些美好的时光
和我的嘎嘎一起。

12:06.896 --> 12:09.068
JASON, I HAVE TO BE HONEST.
杰森，我必须诚实。

12:09.172 --> 12:10.655
THERE'S SOMEONE ELSE.
还有其他人。

12:10.758 --> 12:12.000
GRANDPA?
爷爷？

12:12.103 --> 12:13.517
SPONGEBOB, HELP!
海绵宝宝，救命！

12:13.620 --> 12:14.896
HE'S ON TO ME.
他对我很感兴趣。

12:15.000 --> 12:16.655
I DON'T HAVE MUCH TIME!
我没有太多时间！

12:16.758 --> 12:20.620
[BREATHING HEAVILY]
[呼吸粗重]

12:20.724 --> 12:21.827
PATRICK, WHAT'RE YOU DOING?
帕特里克，你在做什么？

12:21.931 --> 12:24.517
OH, I HAVE TO
GET RID OF THESE BOOKS!
哦，我必须
扔掉这些书！

12:24.620 --> 12:25.206
WHY?
为什么？

12:25.310 --> 12:26.275
I'LL SHOW YOU WHY.
我会告诉你为什么。

12:26.379 --> 12:27.482
Patrick: SEE HIM?
帕特里克：看到他了吗？

12:27.586 --> 12:28.931
HE'S FROM THE LIBRARY.
他来自图书馆。

12:29.034 --> 12:30.724
HE KNOWS ABOUT MY OVERDUE BOOKS.
他知道我过期的书。

12:30.827 --> 12:31.482
SpongeBob: [GASPING]
海绵宝宝：[喘气]

12:31.586 --> 12:32.793
UH-HUH.
嗯嗯。

12:32.896 --> 12:35.413
WHICH MEANS I'M GONNA GET
THROWN IN THE BIG HOUSE.
这意味着我会得到
被扔进大房子里。

12:35.517 --> 12:37.206
AND YOU KNOW WHAT THAT MEANS.
你知道这意味着什么。

12:37.310 --> 12:38.103
SMALL-PORTION MEALS?
少食多餐？

12:38.206 --> 12:39.655
EXACTLY!
确切地！

12:39.758 --> 12:40.551
[CRYING]
[哭泣]

12:40.655 --> 12:42.482
PATRICK, DON'T YOU WORRY.
帕特里克，别担心。

12:42.586 --> 12:44.620
I GOT YOUR BACK, MAN.
我支持你，伙计。

12:44.724 --> 12:45.827
AHEM, HI, THERE.
咳咳，嗨，在那里。

12:45.931 --> 12:47.724
SALUTATIONS, YOUNG ONE.
致敬，年轻人。

12:47.827 --> 12:52.103
SAY, YOU WOULDN'T HAPPEN
TO KNOW THE STARFISH THAT LIVES
UNDER THIS ROCK, WOULD YOU?
说，你不会发生
了解生活中的海星
在这块岩石下，你愿意吗？

12:52.206 --> 12:53.137
HUH?
嗯？

12:53.241 --> 12:54.965
NO, I DON'T KNOW ANY STARFISH.
不，我不认识海星。

12:55.068 --> 12:57.655
HEH, EVEN IF I DID KNOW
THIS "ALLEGED" STARFISH,
呵呵，即使我知道
这只“据称”的海星，

12:57.758 --> 13:00.034
PATRICK WOULDN'T OWE
ANY OVERDUE LIBRARY BOOKS.
帕特里克不会欠债
任何逾期的图书馆书籍。

13:00.137 --> 13:03.758
WELL, IT'S TOO BAD
YOU DON'T KNOW PATRICK STAR,
嗯，太糟糕了
你不了解帕特里克·斯塔，

13:03.862 --> 13:07.620
BECAUSE I AM FROM
THE ROYAL MINISTRY AND HAVE
A GIFT FOR HIM.
因为我来自
皇室和有
送给他的礼物。

13:07.724 --> 13:08.931
OOH, WHAT IS IT?
哦，这是什么？

13:09.034 --> 13:10.172
OH, PRETTY.
哦，漂亮。

13:15.965 --> 13:18.103
THIS IS
THE WORST-TASTING GIFT, EVER.
这是
有史以来最难吃的礼物。

13:18.206 --> 13:21.241
THAT'S BECAUSE
YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO WEAR IT,
NOT EAT IT.
那是因为
你应该穿上它，
不要吃它。

13:21.344 --> 13:23.275
ALLOW ME TO SHOW YOU SOMETHING.
请允许我向您展示一些东西。

13:23.379 --> 13:25.620
IT'S HERE... AH-HA!
它在这里...啊哈！

13:25.724 --> 13:29.896
WHAT I HOLD IN MY HANDS
IS A FAMILY TREE
THAT GOES BACK CENTURIES.
我手里拿着什么
是一棵家谱
这可以追溯到几个世纪前。

13:30.000 --> 13:34.068
IT STARTS WITH THE MARRIAGE OF
KING AMOEBA AND QUEEN MILDEW.
一切从结婚开始
阿米巴王和霉菌女王。

13:34.172 --> 13:39.793
THEN, THROUGH A FEW
INBRED GENERATIONS,
ENDS AT YOU, SIR PATRICK.
然后，通过一些
近交后代，
到你为止了，帕特里克爵士。

13:39.896 --> 13:42.896
WHICH MAKES YOU
A DESCENDANT OF ROYALTY.
这让你
皇室后裔。

13:43.000 --> 13:44.931
YOU ARE A KING.
你是国王。

13:45.034 --> 13:47.931
AND NOW, IT'S TIME I ADJOURNED
TO THE ROYAL MINISTRY,
现在，我该休会了
致王室，

13:48.034 --> 13:52.655
WHERE I SHALL BE
AT YOUR SERVICE, YOUR HIGHNESS.
我会在哪里
竭诚为您服务，殿下。

13:52.758 --> 13:54.379
WOW, PATRICK, THAT'S GREAT!
哇，帕特里克，太棒了！

13:54.482 --> 13:55.068
WHAT IS?
什么是？

13:55.172 --> 13:56.000
THAT YOU'RE KING!
你就是国王！

13:56.103 --> 13:57.241
WHAT'S A KING?
什么是国王？

13:57.344 --> 13:59.896
WHEN YOU'RE A KING,
YOU CAN GET ANYTHING YOU WANT.
当你是国王时，
您可以获得任何您想要的东西。

14:00.000 --> 14:01.482
ANYTHING I WANT?
我想要什么吗？

14:01.586 --> 14:02.793
[RUMBLING]
[隆隆声]

14:02.896 --> 14:05.620
SPONGEBOB, DO YOU THINK
WE COULD GET SOMETHIN' TO EAT?
海绵宝宝，你觉得
我们可以吃点东西吗？

14:05.724 --> 14:08.482
YOUR WISH IS MY COMMAND,
YOUR MAJESTY.
你的愿望就是我的命令，
陛下。

14:08.586 --> 14:10.517
[LAUGHING]
[笑]

14:11.379 --> 14:13.172
SpongeBob: GOOD TOWNSPEOPLE,
海绵宝宝：好镇民，

14:13.275 --> 14:17.482
LET US REJOICE IN WELCOMING
OUR NEW KING.
让我们欢欣鼓舞
我们的新国王。

14:17.586 --> 14:19.517
KING NEEDS FOOD, BADLY.
国王急需食物。

14:19.620 --> 14:21.172
WHAT'S THIS ALL ABOU- [GASPING]
这是怎么回事-[喘气]

14:24.379 --> 14:27.275
WELL, WELL, WELL,
WHAT CAN I DO FOR YOU, PATRICK?
好，好，好，
我能为你做什么，帕特里克？

14:27.379 --> 14:28.517
THE KING WOULD LIKE-
国王想要——

14:28.620 --> 14:29.655
ZIP IT, SQUAREPANTS.
拉上拉链，四角裤。

14:29.758 --> 14:31.482
I'M TALKING TO THE RICH GUY.
我正在和那个有钱人说话。

14:31.586 --> 14:36.000
I'LL HAVE TEN KRABBY PATTIES,
A KRABBY MILKSHAKE,
LARGE FRIES...
我要十块蟹肉饼
蟹黄奶昔，
大薯条...

14:36.103 --> 14:38.379
I'VE GOT A BETTER IDEAR.
我有一个更好的主意。

14:38.482 --> 14:42.724
[EATING LOUDLY]
[大声吃东西]

14:42.827 --> 14:45.931
A BUFFET FIT FOR A KING.
适合国王的自助餐。

14:46.034 --> 14:48.241
[BURPING] TASTY.
[打嗝]好吃。

14:48.344 --> 14:49.827
LISTEN, PATRICK.
听着，帕特里克。

14:49.931 --> 14:53.379
THERE COMES A TIME
IN EVERY MAN'S LIFE
WHEN HE'S GOTTA SETTLE DOWN.
总有一天会到来
在每个人的生活中
当他必须安定下来的时候。

14:53.482 --> 14:57.827
YOU KNOW, GET A WIFE, KIDS,
A FATHER-IN-LAW YOU GIVE ALL OF
YOUR MONEY TO.
你知道，娶妻生子，
一个你给予所有的岳父
您的钱。

14:57.931 --> 14:59.034
UH-HUH, THAT SOUNDS GREAT.
嗯嗯，听起来不错。

14:59.137 --> 15:01.517
HEY, CAN I GET
A LITTLE MORE KETCHUP?
嘿，我可以得到吗
