您支付支票吗？

15:03.689 --> 15:04.793
OH, SORRY, MR. KRABS.
哦，对不起，先生。螃蟹。

15:04.896 --> 15:06.275
NO CAN DO.
没有办法。

15:06.379 --> 15:10.551
AS KING OF BIKINI BOTTOM,
I AM ALLOWED TO HAVE
ANYTHING I WANT.
作为比基尼泳裤之王，
我可以拥有
我想要的任何东西。

15:10.655 --> 15:12.034
ISN'T THAT RIGHT, SPONGEBOB?
这不对吧，海绵宝宝？

15:12.137 --> 15:13.206
THAT IS CORRECT.
这是正确的。

15:13.310 --> 15:15.310
ANYTHING YOU WANT,
AND IT'S ALLFREE.
任何你想要的，
而且都是免费的。

15:15.413 --> 15:17.241
[SHOUTING] ALL FREE?
[大喊]全部免费？

15:17.344 --> 15:19.931
Mr. Krabs: NOBODY EATS
IN ME RESTAURANT FOR FREE!
