在我的餐厅免费！

15:20.034 --> 15:21.206
KING OR NO KING!
国王或没有国王！

15:22.655 --> 15:24.068
ARE YOU GONNA EAT THAT?
你要吃那个吗？

15:24.172 --> 15:25.965
I WAS PLANNING TO, WHY?
