什么是 K 向我撒谎？

16:38.827 --> 16:39.586
[LAUGHING NERVOUSLY]
[紧张地笑]

16:39.689 --> 16:40.241
DON'T BE RIDICULOUS, PATRICK.
别开玩笑了，帕特里克。

16:40.344 --> 16:40.689
I NEVER LIE TO YOU.
我从不对你撒谎。

16:40.793 --> 16:41.310
GOOD!
好的！

16:41.413 --> 16:41.724
NOW, TELL HIM.
现在，告诉他。

16:41.827 --> 16:42.827
HI.
你好。

16:42.931 --> 16:44.000
BY PROCLAMATION
OF THE ROYAL MINISTRY,
通过公告
皇家大臣，

16:44.103 --> 16:44.689
THE KING IS ENTITLED TO GET
WHATEVER HE WANTS.
国王有权得到
随他所欲。

16:44.793 --> 16:45.310
[LAUGHING NERVOUSLY]
[紧张地笑]

16:45.413 --> 16:46.034
THIS ISN'T FAIR.
这不公平。

16:46.137 --> 16:46.655
LIFE ISN'T FAIR, PAL.
生活并不公平，朋友。

16:46.758 --> 16:47.413
GET USED TO IT.
习惯它。

16:47.517 --> 16:48.965
Voice: I FINALLY DID IT.
声音：我终于做到了。

16:49.068 --> 16:49.620
AT LONG LAST, I'VE ACQUIRED
ISSUE NUMBER TWO OF
WONDER SPACE FISH!
终于，我获得了
第二期
神奇的太空鱼！

16:49.724 --> 16:51.275
AND IN MINT CONDITION.
状况完好。

16:51.379 --> 16:52.068
NOW MY 40-YEAR-OLD LIFE
ANDMY COMIC BOOK COLLECTION
ARE COMPLETE.
现在我40岁的生活
安米漫画书集
已完成。

16:52.172 --> 16:53.448
MOM'S GONNA BE SO PROUD OF ME.
妈妈会为我感到骄傲的。

16:53.551 --> 16:54.586
NO, SHE WON'T BE, BECAUSE
THESE COMIC BOOKS ARE MINE.
不，她不会，因为
这些漫画书是我的。

16:54.689 --> 16:56.137
BUT I SPENT MY ENTIRE LIFE
COLLECTING THOSE.
但我度过了我的一生
收集那些。

16:56.241 --> 16:56.689
YEAH, WELL NOW YOU CAN SPEND
THE REST OF YOUR LIFE
CRYING ABOUT IT.
是的，现在你可以花钱了
你的余生
为之哭泣。

16:56.793 --> 16:57.517
I'M THE KING!
我是国王！

16:57.620 --> 16:58.379
I... WILL... CRY ABOUT IT.
我……会……为此哭泣。

16:58.482 --> 16:58.896
[CRYING]
CRY RIGHT TO MY MOM!
[哭泣]
向我妈妈哭吧！

16:59.000 --> 16:59.551
