帕特里克：嘿，海绵宝宝！

17:27.344 --> 17:27.965
YES, SIRE?
是的，陛下？

17:30.448 --> 17:33.068
I NEED YOUR OPINION
ON SOMETHING.
我需要你的意见
在某事上。

17:33.172 --> 17:38.275
DO YOU THINK THE GIANT
FLAT SCREEN TV SHOULD GO OVER
THE FANCY EGG DISPLAY,
你认为巨人吗
平板电视应该结束
精美的鸡蛋展示，

17:38.379 --> 17:42.137
OR THE INDOOR SWIMMING POOL?
还是室内游泳池？

17:44.172 --> 17:46.724
[SNORING]
[打鼾]

17:46.827 --> 17:48.482
[BIRDS CHIRPING]
[鸟儿鸣叫]

17:48.586 --> 17:52.275
HELLO, SUNSHINE.
你好，阳光。

17:52.379 --> 17:54.620
[LAUGHING AND SIGHING]
[笑声和叹息]

17:54.724 --> 17:59.965
OOH, WHAT A BEAUTIFUL MORNING.
哦，多么美丽的早晨啊。

18:00.068 --> 18:01.068
JUST PERFECT.
太完美了。

18:01.172 --> 18:03.517
[CRASHING NOISE]
[撞击声]

18:06.103 --> 18:11.206
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

18:11.310 --> 18:14.413
Patrick: BACK... BACK...
帕特里克：回来了……回来了……

18:14.517 --> 18:17.206
BACK... O.K.
返回...好的

18:17.310 --> 18:19.344
YEAH, THAT'S GOOD.
是的，那很好。

18:19.448 --> 18:20.275
PERFECT.
完美的。

18:22.793 --> 18:25.517
[GROANING]
[呻吟]

18:25.620 --> 18:27.310
WHAT, BUT, BUT, BUT, MY HOUSE!
什么，但是，但是，但是，我的房子！

18:27.413 --> 18:28.793
WHAT'S HAPPENED TO MY- UH?
我的——呃，怎么了？

18:28.896 --> 18:32.137
Squidward: SPONGEBOB, PATRICK.
章鱼哥：海绵宝宝，帕特里克。

18:32.241 --> 18:35.034
WHAT THE BARNACLES
IS GOING ON HERE?
什么是藤壶
正在发生吗？

18:35.137 --> 18:36.551
LOOK AT WHAT YOU'VE DONE!
看看你做了什么！

18:36.655 --> 18:38.344
LOOK AT MY POOR FRONT YARD!
看看我可怜的前院！

18:38.448 --> 18:39.724
YOURFRONT YARD?
你的前院？

18:39.827 --> 18:42.655
UM, HIS ROYAL HIGHNESS IS
BUILDING A ROYAL FERRIS WHEEL.
嗯，殿下是
建造皇家摩天轮。

18:42.758 --> 18:43.724
FERRIS WHEEL?
摩天轮？

18:43.827 --> 18:45.517
I KNOW, ISN'T IT GREAT?
我知道，这不是很好吗？

18:45.620 --> 18:48.275
NO, IT'S NOT GREAT,
IT'S HORRIBLE!
不，这不太好，
太可怕了！

18:48.379 --> 18:50.000
OH, THAT'S IT, STOP!
哦，就是这样，停下来！

18:50.103 --> 18:51.931
Squidward: PEOPLE OF
BIKINI BOTTOM, STOP!
章鱼哥：人们
比基尼泳裤，停下来！

18:52.034 --> 18:52.793
STOP!
停止！

18:52.896 --> 18:54.758
PATRICK'S NO KING.
帕特里克不是国王。

18:54.862 --> 18:55.655
LOOK AT HIM.
看看他。

18:55.758 --> 18:57.793
HOW CAN THIS PINK BLOB BE KING?
这个粉红色的斑点怎么能成为国王呢？

18:57.896 --> 18:59.965
UH...
呃……

19:00.068 --> 19:06.344
YOU, CAN YOU HONESTLY BELIEVE
THAT THAT MINDLESS STARFISH COUD
POSSIBLY BE
THE KING OF ANYTHING?
你，你能诚实地相信吗？
那只无意识的海星可以
可能是
万物之王？

19:07.896 --> 19:09.413
KING OF MORONS.
白痴之王。

19:09.517 --> 19:10.241
MAYBE!
或许！

19:10.344 --> 19:11.862
HE MIGHT BE ON TO SOMETHIN'.
他可能正在做某事。

19:11.965 --> 19:17.206
YEAH, YEAH, UH-HUH, UH-HUH,
SEE, SEE, SEE, SEE.
是啊是啊，嗯嗯，嗯嗯，
看看，看看，看看，看看。

19:17.310 --> 19:19.862
Crowd: YEAH, YEAH.
众人：是啊是啊。

19:19.965 --> 19:23.413
Man: YEAH, WHY ARE WE GIVIN'
THIS GUY ALL OF OUR STUFF?
男人：是啊，我们为什么要付出
这个人是我们所有的东西？

19:23.517 --> 19:25.241
SEE, SEE?
看到了吗？

19:25.344 --> 19:26.896
YOU'RE NOT A KING.
你不是国王。

19:27.000 --> 19:30.793
AND NOW THEY ALL THINK SO, TOO.
现在他们也这么认为。

19:30.896 --> 19:33.034
GET HIM!
抓住他！

19:33.137 --> 19:34.689
ATTACK!
攻击！

19:34.793 --> 19:36.034
ATTACK!
攻击！

19:36.137 --> 19:39.689
Patrick: [BREATHING HEAVILY]
帕特里克：[呼吸粗重]

19:39.793 --> 19:42.275
SPONGEBOB, GET HIM!
海绵宝宝，抓住他！

19:42.379 --> 19:44.586
SO I DECREE.
所以我决定。

19:44.689 --> 19:45.620
ATTACK!
攻击！

19:45.724 --> 19:48.793
UH, RIGHT AWAY, YOUR MAJESTY.
呃，马上，陛下。

19:48.896 --> 19:49.586
UH, SQUIDWARD?
呃，章鱼哥？

19:49.689 --> 19:51.551
WHAT?
什么？

19:51.655 --> 19:55.931
UM, COULD I GET YOU TO SIGN
THIS TREATY PROMISING YOUR
ETERNAL LOYALTY TO KING PATRICK?
嗯，我可以让你签名吗
本条约向您承诺
对帕特里克国王的永恒忠诚？

19:56.034 --> 19:56.827
GIVE ME THAT!
给我那个！

19:56.931 --> 19:58.068
Squidward: A TREATY, HUH?
章鱼哥：一个条约，嗯？

19:58.172 --> 20:03.551
WELL, HERE'S WHAT I THINK
OF YOUR TREATY.
嗯，这就是我的想法
您的条约。

20:03.655 --> 20:06.275
MY ROYAL SUBJECTS
HAVE DESERTED ME.
我的皇家主题
抛弃了我。

20:06.379 --> 20:09.620
AND IT'S ALL 'CAUSE OF
THAT HORRIBLE SQUIDWARD.
这都是因为
那个可怕的章鱼哥。

20:09.724 --> 20:11.137
THIS IS ALL HIS FAULT!
这都是他的错！

20:11.241 --> 20:13.275
HIS, HIS, NOT MINE, HIS!
他的，他的，不是我的，他的！

20:13.379 --> 20:14.965
[ELECTRICAL ZAPPING]
[电动电击]

20:15.068 --> 20:16.275
UH, OH...
呃，哦...

20:16.379 --> 20:18.379
PATRICK, WHAT'S HAPPENED TO YOU?
帕特里克，你怎么了？

20:18.482 --> 20:20.379
I DON'T KNOW WHAT YOU MEAN.
我不知道你的意思。

20:20.482 --> 20:22.758
UH... [LAUGHING NERVOUSLY]
呃……[紧张地笑]

20:22.862 --> 20:26.310
YOU KNOW, ACTUALLY,
MR. KRABS IS PROBABLY WONDERING
WHERE I AM, AND-
事实上，你知道，
先生。蟹蟹可能在想
我在哪里，并且-

20:26.413 --> 20:28.206
AND WHAT?
还有什么？

20:28.310 --> 20:34.379
AND, WELL, IT'S JUST THAT, UM,
而且，嗯，只是这样，嗯，

20:34.482 --> 20:37.137
YOU'RE KIND OF BEING A JERK.
你真是个混蛋。

20:37.241 --> 20:38.586
HUH?
嗯？

20:38.689 --> 20:41.310
[LAUGHING]
[笑]

20:41.413 --> 20:45.068
I THOUGHT YOU WERE GOING TO SAY
I WAS ABUSING MY POWER.
我以为你会说
我在滥用权力。

20:45.172 --> 20:47.172
UH, WELL, I-
呃，好吧，我-

20:47.275 --> 20:51.758
[SCREAMING]: WHO'S SAYING
I'M ABUSING MY POWER?
[尖叫]：谁在说
我滥用权力？

20:51.862 --> 20:54.241
I'LL PUT THE WHOLE TOWN
IN PRISON!
我会把整个城镇
在监狱里！

20:54.344 --> 20:57.896
QUESTIONING MY AUTHORITY
IS TREASON!
质疑我的权威
是叛国！

20:58.000 --> 21:02.379
ALL THESE GIGGLY SPEECHES
ARE MAKING ME THIRSTY.
所有这些咯咯笑的演讲
让我口渴了。

21:02.482 --> 21:06.758
SPONGEBOB, I REQUEST A DRINK.
海绵宝宝，我要一杯饮料。

21:06.862 --> 21:07.862
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

21:09.724 --> 21:10.172
[GROWLING]
[咆哮]

21:10.275 --> 21:11.793
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

21:11.896 --> 21:15.896
UH, GEE, EVERYBODY'S GONE.
呃，哎呀，大家都走了。

21:16.000 --> 21:18.137
I'M ALL ALONE.
我一个人。

21:18.241 --> 21:20.344
FINE, I'LL GET IT MYSELF.
好吧，我自己去拿。

21:20.448 --> 21:22.172
Monstrous Voice: KNOCK, KNOCK.
可怕的声音：敲，敲。

21:22.275 --> 21:23.275
HUH?
嗯？

21:23.379 --> 21:24.620
A KNOCK-KNOCK JOKE.
一个敲门笑话。

21:24.724 --> 21:25.551
WHO'S THERE?
谁在那儿？

21:25.655 --> 21:27.586
YOU.
你。

21:27.689 --> 21:29.206
I DON'T GET IT.
我不明白。

21:29.310 --> 21:32.517
I'M YOU, AND YOU ARE ME.
我就是你，你就是我。

21:35.310 --> 21:39.034
AUGH, WHAT HAVE I BECOME?
啊，我变成了什么？

21:39.137 --> 21:39.724
[SCREAMING]
[尖叫]

21:39.827 --> 21:42.241
A MONSTER, MONSTER!
怪物，怪物！

21:42.344 --> 21:43.172
HUH?
嗯？

21:43.275 --> 21:45.068
OH, OH, IT'S, IT'S YOU.
哦，哦，是，是你。

21:45.172 --> 21:46.689
Patrick: HERE, HERE, TAKE IT.
帕特里克：这里，这里，拿走它。

21:46.793 --> 21:48.206
I DON'T WANT IT ANYMORE.
我不再想要它了。

21:48.310 --> 21:50.517
IT'S TURNED ME INTO A MONSTER.
它把我变成了一个怪物。

21:50.620 --> 21:53.965
OH, I THINK I KNOW
WHAT'S GOING ON HERE.
哦，我想我知道
这是怎么回事。

21:54.068 --> 21:58.310
PATRICK, WITH GREAT POWER
COMES GREAT RESPONSIBILITY.
帕特里克，拥有强大的力量
责任重大。

21:58.413 --> 21:59.551
[SHUDDERING]
[颤抖]

21:59.655 --> 22:02.517
YOU HAVEN'T A CLUE
WHAT I JUST TOLD YOU, DO YOU?
你不知道
我刚才告诉你的，你知道吗？

22:02.620 --> 22:03.241
NO, UH-UH.
不，呃-呃。

22:03.344 --> 22:04.724
WELL, JUST AS WELL.
好吧，也好。

22:04.827 --> 22:06.931
I'VE COME TO TAKE
THE CROWN BACK,
我来接受
表冠背面，

22:07.034 --> 22:10.275
AS IT WOULD SEEM THAT
YOU AREN'T ROYALTY AFTER ALL.
看起来
你毕竟不是皇室成员。

22:10.379 --> 22:11.620
HUH?
嗯？

22:11.724 --> 22:16.137
I DISCOVERED THIS COFFEE STAIN,
WHICH, UPON REMOVAL,
我发现了这个咖啡渍，
拆除后，

22:16.241 --> 22:20.793
REVEALS THAT SIR GARY
IS THE TRUE HEIR
TO THE KING'S CROWN.
加里爵士透露
是真正的继承人
走向国王的王冠。

22:22.137 --> 22:24.206
WELL, WOULD YOU LOOK AT THAT.
好吧，你能看一下吗？

22:24.310 --> 22:26.103
GARY, YOU'RE ROYALTY.
加里，你是皇室成员。

22:29.000 --> 22:30.827
MAOW?
毛？

毛？